      "source": "https://centralmontana.com/communities/floweree/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1873, Daniel Floweree drove 1,500 cattle across the Chisholm Trail, founding a sprawling ranch that bore the F Triangle brand.",
